id: GO:0035014
name: phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase regulator activity
namespace: molecular_function
def: "Modulates the activity of any of the phosphatidylinositol 3-kinases (PI3Ks). Regulatory subunits can link a PI3K catalytic subunit to upstream signaling events and help position the catalytic subunits close to their lipid substrates." [GOC:bf, PMID:9255069]
