[Term]
id: GO:0044027
name: negative regulation of gene expression via CpG island methylation
namespace: biological_process
def: "An epigenetic gene regulation mechanism that negatively regulates gene expression by methylation of cytosine residues in chromosomal CpG islands. CpG islands are genomic regions that contain a high frequency of the CG dinucleotide and are often associated with the transcription start site of genes." [GOC:jl, Wikipedia:Cpg_island]
synonym: "DNA hypermethylation of CpG island" EXACT []
synonym: "epigenetic regulation of gene expression via CpG island hypermethylation" EXACT []
